    "text": "income of each such company after deducting thegains and profits from dividends received from asubsidiary which is part of such taxable income ofeach such company, for such year of assessment,notwithstanding that the taxable income of any oneof such companies does not exceed rupees twothousand million.",
    "fonts": [
