    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      304.33,
      397.19,
      365.8
    ],
    "text": "(2) In calculating the aggregate of the taxable income underparagraph (b) of subsection (1), any subsidiary or any holdingcompany of such group of companies which has a nil amountdue to losses or unrelieved losses, shall not be taken intoaccount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      379.93,
      397.2,
      466.6
    ],
    "text": "(3) Where the Commissioner-General has approved analternative period of twelve months under the provisions ofthe Inland Revenue Act, No. 24 of 2017, for the purpose ofmaintaining accounts of any company liable to pay the taxunder this Act, such approved period shall be deemed to bethe year of assessment commenced on April 1, 2020, for thepurposes of this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      480.73,
      397.19,
      554.8
    ],
    "text": "(4) Every individual, partnership, company and thesubsidiaries and the holding company of every group ofcompany liable to pay the tax under this Act, shall pay the taxin two equal installments on or before, the thirty first day ofMarch and thirtieth day of June of 2022, to the Commissioner-General.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      568.93,
      397.19,
      605.2
    ],
    "text": "(5) The tax shall be collected by the Commissioner-Generaland shall be remitted to the Consolidated Fund within fifteendays from the date of collection.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      619.33,
      397.17,
      668.2
    ],
    "text": "(6) Any subsequent liquidation process of a subsidiary orthe holding company of a group of companies shall notindemnify any such company from the liability of paying thetax under this Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
